ion as if she's gazing at her reflection in a mirror.  \n\nThere might be a box of “spare parts” nearby.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1G14u6sdW6ZCSHxfqeUX3oJJBHZutTuQG?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1G14u6sdW6ZCSHxfqeUX3oJJBHZutTuQG?usp=sharing\n\n\nホロライブIDのクレジ・オリーを描いてほしい。  \n胸を大きく、背を高く、砂時計型の体型にしてほしい。  \nドライブを参照：  \n\n\nゾンビという設定で、この画像のように手足や身体パーツを交換できる仕様にしたい。   \n\n鏡に映った自分を眺めているような表情でお願いします。    \n\n近くに「予備パーツ」の箱があるかもしれません。", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 35807, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "大慈", "screen_name": "daiji_1031", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1442090891896778767/Wrzf5B-3.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1623247417/1678502633/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 40886, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "みさほみ", "screen_name": "misaho_mi", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2Fwebpublic-76fa3aba-0290-42be-a2ef-c5e8765d92a5.png&avatar=1", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 89792, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "まっさかさま", "screen_name": "ma_sakasama", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/879225549675085824/zQ07w4Jd.jpg", "header_url": "https://pb